without releasing keyboard or controller sources. Inline tests verify
stale contact motion, fresh presses and independent held sources; the
accelerated native smoke checks pre-draw rejection, aspect-fit letterbox
rejection, and projection after stretch and adaptive target redraws.
Fresh validation with Xvfb, software GL, dummy audio and portable core
checks passed in run 1795620220187553166-3438625. Physical touch hardware
and high-DPI display acceptance remain open.

